{"meta":{"id":"tt33022938","type":"series","name":"La Casa de los Espiritus","imdb_id":"tt33022938","description":"Una saga familiar magnífica que narra la épica historia de una familia orgullosa y apasionada, amores secretos y una revolución sangrienta. Las pasiones, las luchas y los secretos de la familia Trueba abarcan un siglo de cambios sociales violentos, culminando en una crisis que lanzan al orgulloso y tiránico patriarca y a su querida nieta en direcciones opuestas.","poster":"https://btttr.cc/poster-q/imdb/poster-default/tt33022938.jpg?tag=none&lang=es-MX&rs=IM","background":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/u2nBtDrTOIi9u78c02bL0A3lo7Y.jpg","logo":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/jNge5nhp8T8tLU9Pybuf8zMcSQO.png","genres":["Drama"],"releaseInfo":"2026","released":"2026-04-29T12:00:00.000Z","status":"Ended","imdbRating":"7.7","country":"United States of America","cast":["Alfonso Herrera","Dolores Fonzi","Nicole Wallace","Sara Becker","Nicolás Contreras","Fernanda Castillo","Néstor Cantillana","Fernanda Urrejola","Pablo Macaya","Rocío Hernández","Aline Küppenheim","Eduard Fernández","Chiara Parravicini","Juan Pablo Raba","Francesca Turco","Noelia Coñuenao","Luis Dubó","Consuelo Holzapfel","Emilio Edwards","Diego Mayegas","Amparo Noguera","Antonia Zegers","Catalina Saavedra","Pedro de Tavira","Juanita Reale","Gabriela Aguilera","Nicolás Francella","Pedro Fontaine","Carmen Zabala","Maribel Verdú"],"writer":["Francisca Alegría","Fernanda Urrejola","Isabel Allende","Germán Maggiori","Natalia Quevedo"],"trailers":[{"source":"KaniPxYVbMU","type":"Trailer","name":"Official Trailer [Subtitled]","ytId":"KaniPxYVbMU","lang":"en"}],"trailerStreams":[{"ytId":"KaniPxYVbMU","title":"Official Trailer [Subtitled]"}],"links":[{"name":"7.7","category":"imdb","url":"https://imdb.com/title/tt33022938"},{"name":"Drama","category":"Genres","url":"stremio:///discover/https%3A%2F%2Fv3-cinemeta.strem.io%2Fmanifest.json/series/top?genre=Drama"},{"name":"Alfonso Herrera","catego